# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "From your terminal, run the command:\n"
msgstr "터미널에서 다음 명령을 실행하세요:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
